* Set PROPCTL(ALL) on all pipeline queues.
* This ensures MQRFH2 headers (carrying W3C traceparent + baggage) are
* preserved regardless of whether the producer is JMS or native MQ (C/COBOL).
* COMPAT only works when every producer is JMS-based — ALL is the safe default.
* Note: PROPCTL is a queue attribute — ALTER QMGR PROPCTL is NOT valid syntax.
ALTER QLOCAL(DEV.QUEUE.1) PROPCTL(ALL)
ALTER QLOCAL(DEV.QUEUE.2) PROPCTL(ALL)
ALTER QLOCAL(DEV.QUEUE.3) PROPCTL(ALL)
ALTER QLOCAL(DEV.DEAD.LETTER.QUEUE) PROPCTL(ALL)
